Z||000000||Shaun41178||03-15-2000||07:58 PM||||My boss drives a 97 Camaro 6 spd with the lt-1 rated at 285 hp.  He has a flowmaster muffler and some K&N thingamajig for mods and thats it. We went behind the building where I worked and lined up. We agreed on a spot to race to, which from what I could tell was damn near close to a qtr mile. So I say ready, set, go, and pause for a split second to make sure that he had time to react to me saying go as I could have easily had the jump on him as I know when I am saying go. I didn't want him to say that I left before him. We both fried our tires big time. This road was pretty slippery and the fact that we both drove through a small puddle of water before lining up. Looking in my mirror I see him smoking big time as I hook and start to pull on him. Not really paying atttention to how many times my tranny shifted but we got to the marked off spot and it was d@mn close. I honestly can't say who won. He was coming on much stronger then me at the end as when we went past the marker he was passing me and I hit the brakes to slow down. I either got him by a nose or he got me by a nose. Unfortunatly noone was at the finish to tell us who won. He didn't know who won nor did I so we just agreed it was a tie. I asked him if he wanted to go one more time to see if there would be a different outcome but he declined as he didn't want to get caught as I understand his driving record isn't perfect. Maybe another day.<P>Shaun<BR>85 GT with nitrous <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178</A> <BR>14.1@89||||reg||2
